  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "### 14.4.11\n\n* Fixes native libraries that required macOS 26; the minimum supported macOS version is now 14.0.\n\n#### Imaging\n\n* Fixes an exception when drawing a clipped image onto another image in the cross-platform .NET package.\n\n#### Ocr\n\n* Fixes a crash when OCR with several languages reads a word differently in each language.\n\n#### Office\n\n* Fixes Markdown-to-PDF conversion producing raster pages with no extractable text. (L#GDPIC-1660)\n* Fixes PowerPoint tables using the \"No Style, No Grid\" table style being rendered with black cell borders. (L#MAMBO-2132)\n* Fixes right-to-left text order and column-break layout when converting Word documents to PDF. (J#MAMBO-2045)\n* Fixes Word documents failing to open with InvalidParameter when a table cell spans zero grid columns. (L#MAMBO-2136)\n\n#### Pdf\n\n* Fixes title metadata preservation and annotation placement when editing PDF tags.",
